**Language note:** §15 sets Russian as the operator-facing language, but this session's system instruction requires English and outranks the skill, so the messages below are in English.

## Moment 1 (02:10)

**Tool call: Bash, `run_in_background: true`**

```bash
herdr agent wait relay-impl --timeout 2700000; \
herdr agent read relay-impl --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > ~/scratch/inbox/relay-impl.last
```

`~/scratch/inbox` stands for my inbox directory. I make no other call and then end my turn.

**Message to the operator:**

