> **Next:** a background waiter wakes me the moment the tab stops, whether it finished, hit a dialog or ran out of time. I ping you right then with what it claims, re-run the tests myself at its head commit, and send the verified result with the exact steps for your test. What will exist at that point is a branch in a worktree; nothing reaches `ccs-it` before review, validation and merge.
