## Moment 2 (02:24)

**Tool call first:** one foreground `herdr agent get relay-impl`, which returns `working`. I send no new waiter and nothing into the tab.

**Reply:**

> **Still running. There is no test result yet.** `relay-impl` is 14 minutes into its 25–45-minute time box and has not reported. What is on a running agent's screen is partial and unverified, so I am not calling anything green from it.
>
> **Next:** the waiter wakes me when the tab stops (02:55 at the latest). I ping you at once, re-run the tests at the head commit, and send the verified result with your test steps.
